@startuml 时序图_AI分析流程
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false

title 408Master AI 工作台分析流程时序图

actor 学生 as student #E3F2FD
participant "学生端\nVue 3" as vue
participant "Nginx" as nginx
participant "AiWorkbenchController\n/AIAnalysisController" as controller
participant "AiOrchestratorService\nAI 编排器" as orchestrator
participant "AiIntentRouter\n意图路由" as router
participant "AnalysisService\n分析服务" as analysis
participant "RagService\nRAG 检索" as rag
participant "StudentGraphService\n学习画像" as profile
database "MySQL" as mysql
database "Qdrant\n向量库" as qdrant
participant "智谱 GLM\nChat API" as glm

== 1. 发起 AI 分析 ==
student -> vue : 点击「AI 解析」或\n在工作台输入问题
vue -> nginx : GET /api/student/ai/workbench/stream\n(Accept: text/event-stream)
nginx -> controller : stream(request)
controller -> orchestrator : streamChat(request)

== 2. 意图识别 ==
orchestrator -> router : classifyIntent(query)
router --> orchestrator : intent=explain_question\n(或 explain_knowledge /\ncompose_paper / ...)

== 3. RAG 知识检索 ==
orchestrator -> rag : retrieve(query, topK=5)
rag -> qdrant : search(embedding,\ncollection=xzs_408_chunks)
qdrant --> rag : Top-K 相关知识切片
rag -> mysql : INSERT rag_retrieval_log\n(检索日志)
rag --> orchestrator : List<RagChunk>\n(相关知识内容)

== 4. 加载学生画像 ==
orchestrator -> profile : getProfile(userId)
profile -> mysql : SELECT student_knowledge_state\n+ student_learning_event
mysql --> profile : 掌握度、薄弱点
profile --> orchestrator : 学习画像数据

== 5. 构建 Prompt 并调用 LLM ==
orchestrator -> orchestrator : 组装 Prompt\n(系统提示 + 知识切片\n+ 画像 + 用户问题)
orchestrator -> analysis : analyzeStream(prompt)
analysis -> mysql : SELECT ai_provider_config\nWHERE enabled=1
mysql --> analysis : GLM 配置
analysis -> glm : POST /v4/chat/completions\n(stream=true)
glm --> analysis : SSE token 流
analysis --> orchestrator : Flux<String>

== 6. 流式响应 ==
orchestrator --> controller : Flux<String>
controller --> nginx : SSE data: {...}
nginx --> vue : SSE 流式数据
vue --> student : 逐字显示 AI 回复

== 7. 记录日志 ==
orchestrator -> mysql : INSERT ai_run_log\n(请求/响应/Token数/耗时)
orchestrator -> mysql : INSERT rag_answer_citation\n(引用的知识切片)
orchestrator -> mysql : INSERT student_learning_event\n(AI 交互事件)

@enduml
